{"_note":"评分详情卡(v40:卡高由 app.df 的 rateH 二选一 196/140 —— 观察不足 2 天没有走势条时不再留一块 56pt 空白;走势基线 = {parent.h}-28,条的 y 用数据层的 sparkBase 减条高,RCN 坐标里「变量减常量」不求值):四区对比(rg,来自 page/flow/regions.df)+ 14 日新增评分走势(sbars,来自 app.df 的本机序列快照)。四区某区 `--` = 该区真下架,是信号不是 bug。走势条从左(最旧)到右(今天),今天那根用源色。星级 1–5 直方图与用户评论拿不到(评论 RSS 已死、amp-api 逆向被 G5#3 禁),这两块就是替代。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"type":"op","action":"forEach","props":{"items":"${rg}","key":"_it","index":"_i"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_ry","value":"$[calc::(14+${_i}*26)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_p","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.p},0)]"}},{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"${_ry}pt","w":"36pt","h":"20pt","text":"$[if::(eq::(${_it.cc},US),${@i18n.rgUS},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},GB),${@i18n.rgGB},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},JP),${@i18n.rgJP},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},DE),${@i18n.rgDE},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},FR),${@i18n.rgFR},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},CA),${@i18n.rgCA},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},AU),${@i18n.rgAU},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},KR),${@i18n.rgKR},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},BR),${@i18n.rgBR},if::(eq::(${_it.cc},CN),${@i18n.rgCN},${_it.cc}))))))))))]","fontSize":"10.5pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1","alignmentV":"1"},{"type":"layer","x":"54pt","y":"${_ry}pt+7pt","w":"{parent.w}-140pt","h":"6pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3pt","leftB":"3pt","rightT":"3pt","rightB":"3pt"},"bgColor":"#E7E9EE|#20232A"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(${_p},1)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"54pt","y":"${_ry}pt+7pt","w":"({parent.w}-140pt)*${_p}/100","h":"6pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3pt","leftB":"3pt","rightT":"3pt","rightB":"3pt"},"bgColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF"}]},{"type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-78pt","y":"${_ry}pt","w":"62pt","h":"20pt","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.v},--)]","fontSize":"12pt","alignmentH":"2","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1","alignmentV":"1","paddingRight":"2pt"}]},{"type":"op","action":"forEach","props":{"items":"${sbars}","key":"_b","index":"_i"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_bh","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${_b.h},0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_by","value":"$[calc::(${sparkBase}-${_bh})]"}},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_bh},1),if::(lt::(${_i},12),1,0),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"16pt+({parent.w}-32pt)*${_i}/13","y":"${_by}pt","w":"(({parent.w}-32pt)/13)-3pt","h":"${_bh}pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"2pt","leftB":"0pt","rightT":"2pt","rightB":"0pt"},"bgColor":"#BFDCFA|#243447"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_bh},1),if::(ge::(${_i},12),1,0),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"16pt+({parent.w}-32pt)*${_i}/13","y":"${_by}pt","w":"(({parent.w}-32pt)/13)-3pt","h":"${_bh}pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"2pt","leftB":"0pt","rightT":"2pt","rightB":"0pt"},"bgColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF"}]}]},{"id":"base","type":"layer","x":"16pt","y":"{parent.h}-28pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"1pt","bgColor":"#E4E7EC|#262A31"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(findNotEmpty::(${sparkN},0),2)]"},"react":[{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"{parent.h}-20pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.spark1} $[findNotEmpty::(${sparkN},0)] ${@i18n.spark2}","fontSize":"9.5pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${sparkN},0),2),0,1)]"},"react":[{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"{parent.h}-20pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.sparkEmpty}","fontSize":"9.5pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"spark1":"近","spark2":"日 · 每日新增评分(本机观察)","sparkEmpty":"走势从明天开始积累 —— 每观察一天多一根","rgUS":"美国","rgGB":"英国","rgJP":"日本","rgDE":"德国","rgFR":"法国","rgCA":"加拿大","rgAU":"澳洲","rgKR":"韩国","rgBR":"巴西","rgCN":"中国"},"en-US":{"spark1":"Last","spark2":"days · new ratings/day (observed locally)","sparkEmpty":"Trend starts tomorrow — one bar per observed day","rgUS":"US","rgGB":"GB","rgJP":"JP","rgDE":"DE","rgFR":"FR","rgCA":"CA","rgAU":"AU","rgKR":"KR","rgBR":"BR","rgCN":"CN"}}}}
